WEBVTT

00:01:59.233 --> 00:02:00.303
No way...

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:04.300
I can't believe even the Knight Master
Captain Conrad's attacks have no effect!

00:02:04.633 --> 00:02:05.633
Stay strong!

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.530
The whole world will be destroyed
unless we do something about it!

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:28.133
You little!

00:02:43.366 --> 00:02:44.426
We're done for!

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.870
R-Run!

00:02:48.266 --> 00:02:49.266
Come back!

00:02:49.433 --> 00:02:50.673
Stand your ground!

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.200
Conrad!

00:03:01.633 --> 00:03:02.633
It's you guys!

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:05.033
Blue Dragon!

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:06.533
Minotaur!

00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:13.066
Conrad!

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:21.366
Are you okay?

00:03:21.966 --> 00:03:23.396
Yeah. Thanks for the help.

00:03:24.366 --> 00:03:25.366
Conrad...

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:27.226
Shu...

00:03:27.966 --> 00:03:29.026
What is that?

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.130
Do you know?!

00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:33.673
It's...the Darkness.

00:03:34.266 --> 00:03:34.926
The Darkness?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.000
From the legend?

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.003
Where's Zola?

00:03:40.966 --> 00:03:41.966
What happened to her?

00:03:42.533 --> 00:03:45.903
Zola... Zola is...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.600
DISSENSION

00:03:52.133 --> 00:03:53.703
Hurry! Hurry!

00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:55.433
Hurry up, everyone!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.530
Just run! You must survive!

00:03:58.566 --> 00:03:59.626
Legalas!

00:04:04.366 --> 00:04:05.666
It's you guys!

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.870
What the hell is that?!

00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:13.273
What the hell is going on?!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.700
What the hell has happened?!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.770
No, it's pointless to talk to you guys!
Where's Zola?!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.370
Legalas...

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.233
What is it, Sir Conrad?!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.930
It seems Zola brought
about this situation.

00:04:33.233 --> 00:04:35.403
Say what?!

00:04:47.866 --> 00:04:50.266
No way... Zola did this?

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.170
- So what should we do?
- Zola?

00:04:52.633 --> 00:04:54.073
How can we fight against that?

00:04:54.766 --> 00:04:58.266
In order to find that out,
we have to see General Logi.

00:04:59.066 --> 00:05:00.126
What did you say?

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.900
Do you know where
Logi is right now?

00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:07.196
Logi has established the Rosekstan

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:09.673
and is now the greatest enemy
to our allied force.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.400
It seems his ship landed yesterday
at Castillo de la Testa.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.030
We know that place.

00:05:18.566 --> 00:05:20.296
That's the base that
Homeron infiltrated.

00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:22.403
It's quite a distance from here.

00:05:23.033 --> 00:05:25.333
If you're going there,
I'll arrange transportation for you.

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:26.833
That will be a big help.

00:05:27.466 --> 00:05:29.396
The only thing we can do is run.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:34.870
But if the Darkness continues to spread,
there will be nowhere to run

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.430
and everything will be
swallowed up by it.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:40.670
We'll... We'll never let that happen!

00:05:41.266 --> 00:05:45.926
All we can do now is
count on you Soldiers of Light.

00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:54.766
Are you going to stay
frozen forever, Legalas?

00:05:56.066 --> 00:05:58.926
Right! I have to
evacuate everybody!

00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:01.773
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.370
You must all leave the city today!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:07.170
Leave that behind.

00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.866
You can come back for it once
the situation settles back down.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:11.930
We can come back?

00:06:12.533 --> 00:06:14.203
Will that black thing go away?

00:06:17.433 --> 00:06:21.403
Don't worry!
Just leave everything to me!

00:06:24.466 --> 00:06:26.926
Hey! We're counting on you!

00:06:31.633 --> 00:06:35.173
The adjustments to the energy output
are taking longer than we expected.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.070
And the procurement of parts
is not going well, either.

00:06:39.366 --> 00:06:42.566
The eastern supply base was
swallowed by the Darkness, huh?

00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:43.826
Yes, sir...

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.470
General Logi.

00:06:46.266 --> 00:06:48.496
A small allied force ship
is approaching.

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.900
Those Shadow Wielders are on board.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.570
We received a transmission
saying that they want to talk to you.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.730
Oh? They're here
sooner than I thought.

00:06:58.333 --> 00:06:59.333
Are you going to see them?

00:06:59.766 --> 00:07:03.366
We can't stop the Darkness
without their help.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.230
Push to have the work done now.

00:07:05.633 --> 00:07:06.303
Yes, sir!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.100
What do you want with me?

00:07:41.633 --> 00:07:46.073
Because of us, the Soldiers of Light,
the Darkness was released.

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:49.103
If that's the case, then we,
the Soldiers of Light,

00:07:49.133 --> 00:07:51.273
should be able to seal it up
as well, right?

00:07:52.633 --> 00:07:54.533
You're right about that.

00:07:54.966 --> 00:07:55.626
Logi...

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.430
We need your help.

00:07:58.333 --> 00:07:59.003
Oh?

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:03.500
The Darkness was released when
all seven Soldiers of Light were there.

00:08:04.266 --> 00:08:05.966
I think we need all seven
to seal it as well.

00:08:06.466 --> 00:08:08.366
You're right again.

00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:11.566
The way to get
inside the Darkness

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.170
as well as to seal it was
hidden in the Extra Seven.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.870
We can get inside it?!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.630
We can seal it?!

00:08:18.166 --> 00:08:21.626
The only problem for me
is you guys.

00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:23.573
Huh? What do you mean?

00:08:24.033 --> 00:08:26.273
Zola is the one who
released the Darkness.

00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:30.826
If we force our way inside
and attempt to seal it again,

00:08:30.866 --> 00:08:32.326
she will definitely try to stop us.

00:08:32.933 --> 00:08:36.433
So will you be able to defeat her
when that happens?

00:08:37.533 --> 00:08:40.103
We're not going in to defeat her.

00:08:40.933 --> 00:08:41.933
What did you say?

00:08:42.266 --> 00:08:44.596
We're going in to talk to her.

00:08:45.166 --> 00:08:47.926
To find out what she's
really thinking about.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.100
But we will seal the Darkness.

00:08:50.466 --> 00:08:51.896
Are you guys fools?!

00:08:52.266 --> 00:08:53.796
We're smart, maro!

00:08:53.833 --> 00:08:55.873
If it's your intention to
go inside the Darkness

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:57.830
with such a naÃ¯ve mind,
you'll die!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.230
Listen!

00:09:00.733 --> 00:09:03.503
If Zola wants to stop us from
sealing the Darkness again,

00:09:03.533 --> 00:09:05.533
she only needs to
take down one of us.

00:09:05.933 --> 00:09:10.203
If we lose even one Soldier of Light,
we won't be able to seal the Darkness.

00:09:10.933 --> 00:09:13.373
Like what you tried to do
in the Sealed Grounds?

00:09:14.866 --> 00:09:15.866
That's right, maro!

00:09:15.966 --> 00:09:18.896
You focused your attacks
on me, maro!

00:09:18.933 --> 00:09:22.473
At the time,
that was the right thing to do,

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.200
considering the current
situation we're in.

00:09:26.266 --> 00:09:30.326
In retrospect, we should've
just defeated you back then.

00:09:30.766 --> 00:09:31.766
You!

00:09:32.266 --> 00:09:35.026
It's your intention to take
Nene's place, isn't it?

00:09:35.366 --> 00:09:36.366
What're you saying?!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:44.800
Nene tried to rule the world.
But I will bring order to the world.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.700
Then why fight against
the allied force?

00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:53.503
That's an old regime from the past.
I'm going to build a new order.

00:09:54.166 --> 00:09:59.266
Logi. We need seven people for this.
So we will go together with you.

00:09:59.966 --> 00:10:01.266
But promise us this.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.770
Promise that you'll
leave Zola to us.

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.870
I can't make that promise.

00:10:06.433 --> 00:10:09.673
If she attacks us,
I'll have to fight back.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.170
We'll handle that.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.170
What will you do if
she absolutely tries to

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.200
interfere with the sealing
of the Darkness?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.170
We will seal it no matter what.
The world will vanish if we don't.

00:10:19.766 --> 00:10:24.066
In regards to that one point,
we'll have to work together.

00:10:24.466 --> 00:10:26.366
That means we consider
Zola an enemy.

00:10:26.666 --> 00:10:28.296
Follow my orders.

00:10:28.666 --> 00:10:33.126
We won't take orders from you.
You leave Zola alone.

00:10:33.566 --> 00:10:35.826
Then we won't be able to
seal the Darkness.

00:10:35.966 --> 00:10:38.026
We're going to seal the Darkness,
I tell you!

00:10:38.266 --> 00:10:40.166
You're just an unreasonable kid
throwing a fit!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.530
You just listen to what I say!

00:10:55.033 --> 00:10:56.033
- General Logi?!
- Shu?!

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:57.800
You guys stay out of this!

00:10:58.033 --> 00:10:59.833
I'll make him understand!

00:11:00.266 --> 00:11:01.526
Nice, Shu!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.770
I've always wanted to take
this guy down for good!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.300
You're fools to go
against General Logi!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.130
Crushing Nail!

00:11:37.966 --> 00:11:41.096
Isn't this fight kind of pointless?

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.670
Should we stop them?

00:11:44.066 --> 00:11:47.066
That's probably not gonna happen.
General Logi is determined.

00:11:47.633 --> 00:11:48.733
So is Shu.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.870
What'll we do if one of them
is taken down, maro?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.370
That won't happen.

00:11:53.866 --> 00:11:57.126
Right. We wouldn't be able to
seal the Darkness.

00:11:57.433 --> 00:11:59.503
They should both know that.

00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:05.073
I guess they'll fight until they
settle on who's in charge.

00:12:15.533 --> 00:12:19.503
Why can't you understand
that Zola is a threat?!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.700
You're wrong! Zola has
something in mind!

00:12:26.766 --> 00:12:29.596
She wants to destroy the world!

00:12:29.766 --> 00:12:31.996
Logi! You said it earlier
that we need

00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:35.073
all seven Soldiers of Light
to seal the Darkness!

00:12:35.533 --> 00:12:38.303
That's right, unfortunately!

00:12:38.433 --> 00:12:40.473
Zola must know that!

00:12:41.166 --> 00:12:44.726
But she didn't kill
any of us back then!

00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:50.733
We have the power to
seal the Darkness.

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:53.330
She should've killed
one of us back then

00:12:53.366 --> 00:12:55.396
if she didn't want to
be interfered.

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:57.303
Yet she didn't do that!

00:12:57.566 --> 00:12:58.626
Unlike you!

00:13:06.033 --> 00:13:08.373
And just how far are
you going to trust her?

00:13:08.633 --> 00:13:10.003
Don't you think she
had her reasons?

00:13:10.033 --> 00:13:12.303
Or maybe she was just confident?

00:13:12.566 --> 00:13:13.566
No, I don't!

00:13:17.533 --> 00:13:19.333
I'm going to see her one more time!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.630
I'm going to defeat her!

00:13:22.866 --> 00:13:23.866
This is not good!

00:13:23.966 --> 00:13:25.196
They're both serious!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.070
Shu!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:27.270
General Logi!

00:13:32.066 --> 00:13:34.296
What are you guys
doing acting like fools?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.470
What?!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:37.570
That's...

00:13:38.366 --> 00:13:39.366
Delphinium.

00:13:46.966 --> 00:13:50.466
I came here because you said you'd
found a way to get inside that Darkness.

00:13:50.933 --> 00:13:52.773
But what is all this commotion?

00:13:53.133 --> 00:13:55.003
Commotion, commotion!

00:13:55.033 --> 00:13:56.533
What's she doing here?!

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.870
Would you give it a rest?

00:13:59.133 --> 00:13:59.803
What?!

00:14:00.266 --> 00:14:05.726
You could resent me
or hate Logi,

00:14:05.766 --> 00:14:08.996
but we still need
all seven Soldiers of Light.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.830
I know that.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.470
Do you really?

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.300
You don't seem to know that
now's not the time for us

00:14:17.333 --> 00:14:19.203
to be fighting amongst ourselves.

00:14:19.433 --> 00:14:20.903
Don't! Don't!

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:28.670
Delphinium, I appreciate you
coming despite our differences.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.770
I just have more hatred
towards that woman.

00:14:31.866 --> 00:14:34.096
I came here to kill Zola.

00:14:35.433 --> 00:14:38.033
Hold it!
I won't let you do that!

00:14:39.866 --> 00:14:40.866
I'm leaving.

00:14:41.233 --> 00:14:41.903
Huh?

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:43.830
Delphinium?!

00:14:43.866 --> 00:14:46.866
There's no way that I'll team up with
such an unreasonable child.

00:14:47.266 --> 00:14:48.896
No way! No way!

00:14:49.066 --> 00:14:52.126
You! The Darkness will
keep growing, you know!

00:14:52.566 --> 00:14:53.626
It doesn't matter to me.

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:54.970
Wait!

00:14:55.166 --> 00:14:57.396
I'll talk things over with Shu.

00:14:57.633 --> 00:14:58.633
Listen up, Shu.

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:01.800
We can't let her leave right now.

00:15:02.766 --> 00:15:03.766
But...

00:15:04.233 --> 00:15:04.903
So long.

00:15:05.166 --> 00:15:06.596
Oh, wait!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:10.700
Shu! You will work under
my orders for a while!

00:15:11.033 --> 00:15:12.033
Got it?

00:15:13.366 --> 00:15:14.366
Fine.

00:15:15.133 --> 00:15:16.233
Fine!

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:18.526
You heard him, Delphinium!

00:15:20.333 --> 00:15:23.633
Okay, let me hear
the details of your plan.

00:15:24.233 --> 00:15:25.833
Let me! Let me!

00:15:26.966 --> 00:15:29.296
An unexpected peacemaker
has shown up.

00:15:29.666 --> 00:15:33.196
And she settled things with
an impressive technique.

00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:36.273
Maybe we should learn something
from her methods.

00:15:37.066 --> 00:15:40.296
That's the strength of someone
with nothing to lose.

00:15:40.633 --> 00:15:43.973
Reason, profit...
They don't mean much to her.

00:15:44.266 --> 00:15:46.696
Shu couldn't say
anything back, maro.

00:15:47.166 --> 00:15:48.896
Oh, they're coming this way, maro.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:01.300
Now, this group has
gathered together once again.

00:16:01.733 --> 00:16:06.003
Zola has deceived us and made us
take part in releasing of the Darkness.

00:16:06.233 --> 00:16:09.103
But we, the seven
Soldiers of Light,

00:16:09.133 --> 00:16:11.773
have assembled this time
to seal the Darkness.

00:16:12.166 --> 00:16:13.926
And Schneider, Andropov.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:14.870
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

00:16:15.066 --> 00:16:18.626
Your help will be indispensable.
I'm counting on you guys.

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:20.000
Leave it to us.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.800
Uhh, looking forward to
teaming up with you.

00:16:24.266 --> 00:16:25.626
Yeah, same here.

00:16:25.933 --> 00:16:27.533
According to what we've learned...

00:16:27.566 --> 00:16:28.626
General Logi.

00:16:29.333 --> 00:16:30.003
What is it?

00:16:30.333 --> 00:16:32.903
You summon someone and don't even
provide comfortable surroundings?

00:16:34.366 --> 00:16:35.996
Everyone, come with me.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.630
I'm sure the old Soldiers of Light
in the Book of the Beginning

00:16:49.666 --> 00:16:52.766
didn't have such
complicated relationships.

00:16:53.033 --> 00:16:54.573
Yeah, I agree.

00:16:55.533 --> 00:16:57.703
Let's get along, okay?
Even if it means just us.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.570
Huh? Oh, right!

00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:08.196
I'll set aside our past
for now, maro.

00:17:10.666 --> 00:17:12.896
According to what we've learned,

00:17:12.933 --> 00:17:15.433
there were no accounts
of what the Darkness is

00:17:15.466 --> 00:17:18.626
in either the Book of the Beginning
or the Extra Seven.

00:17:19.166 --> 00:17:20.826
So we still don't know, huh?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.730
But we'll get absorbed by the Darkness
if we get caught in it, maro.

00:17:24.866 --> 00:17:28.266
Yeah. And we have no idea
what's happening inside.

00:17:28.566 --> 00:17:31.166
That doesn't matter.

00:17:31.433 --> 00:17:34.703
We're going inside that Darkness.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:39.170
Yes. That's why I'm saying
we should just head right in, boy.

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.400
What?!

00:17:40.633 --> 00:17:42.403
Stop it, Jiro, maro.

00:17:42.766 --> 00:17:45.196
My instincts are
telling me that there's

00:17:45.233 --> 00:17:47.573
no way you can beat her
with words, maro.

00:17:49.166 --> 00:17:51.366
Continue, General Logi.

00:17:51.966 --> 00:17:55.466
We've analyzed the Book of the Beginning
and the Extra Seven,

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.670
and found a way to break
through that Darkness.

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.100
The Darkness has
no effect on Shadows.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:05.300
But I'm not talking about the shadows
that are born from light.

00:18:05.766 --> 00:18:07.496
Are you talking about our Shadows?

00:18:07.933 --> 00:18:11.333
And also about artificially
created Shadows.

00:18:11.933 --> 00:18:14.303
So I used our
Black Shadow technology.

00:18:14.733 --> 00:18:16.773
We will generate
an artificial Shadow.

00:18:17.266 --> 00:18:20.926
We will use it to coat this ship
and then fly into the Darkness.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:23.600
It's something we call
the Shadow Shield.

00:18:24.266 --> 00:18:25.666
When do we leave?

00:18:26.133 --> 00:18:28.003
We're planning to
leave in eight hours.

00:18:28.666 --> 00:18:29.796
How leisurely.

00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:33.003
The seven of us are
already assembled.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.530
It's a matter of getting
ready physically.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.500
According to the report, the work is
scheduled to be complete in nine hours.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.930
We're leaving in eight hours even though
the shield is not ready by then?

00:18:43.366 --> 00:18:46.296
We've calculated the rate at
which the Darkness is growing,

00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:50.403
and have figured that this dock
will be swallowed up in eight hours.

00:18:55.133 --> 00:18:57.703
No change in the rate of
progression of the Darkness.

00:18:58.333 --> 00:19:03.203
So the scheduled launch time
is in eight hours at dawn.

00:19:03.766 --> 00:19:06.696
Make sure you get
enough rest, everyone.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.400
That is all.

00:19:10.966 --> 00:19:13.096
How can we rest?

00:19:13.833 --> 00:19:15.673
If you need beds,
we'll make arrangements.

00:19:16.033 --> 00:19:17.903
I'd rather eat, maro.

00:19:31.766 --> 00:19:33.996
Use this room if you
want to get some rest.

00:19:36.533 --> 00:19:37.533
Umm...

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:41.030
Did you get in trouble after that?

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.170
Huh?

00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:44.303
Because you let me escape...

00:19:44.966 --> 00:19:48.266
I didn't let you escape.
I just forgot the key.

00:19:49.266 --> 00:19:50.266
Thank you.

00:19:57.933 --> 00:20:02.033
Our productivity has gone up.
We should be able to finish in time.

00:20:02.733 --> 00:20:03.403
I see.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.500
Reconnaissance team reporting!

00:20:08.233 --> 00:20:09.403
Can you hear me, General Logi?

00:20:10.166 --> 00:20:10.826
What is it?!

00:20:11.366 --> 00:20:13.226
The Darkness is moving even faster!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:17.100
We'll make contact with the Darkness
sooner than calculated by 10%!

00:20:21.333 --> 00:20:22.003
Logi!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:27.500
Everyone, pray for our safety.

00:20:31.066 --> 00:20:32.866
All hands, to your positions!

00:20:34.633 --> 00:20:36.203
The Darkness is approaching.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:39.700
Approximately three minutes
until contact with this ship,

00:20:39.733 --> 00:20:43.573
but we're not done getting the equipment
ready for generating the Shadow Shield.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:44.770
What?!

00:20:45.033 --> 00:20:46.173
No way!

00:20:46.566 --> 00:20:47.966
Start the engines.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:49.200
Start the engines.

00:20:50.066 --> 00:20:50.726
Captain!

00:20:51.133 --> 00:20:52.803
All the parts are hooked up, right?

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.670
We haven't done a safety inspection
or checked the overall system yet!

00:20:57.166 --> 00:20:59.426
We can't use any
of the other docks.

00:20:59.733 --> 00:21:02.133
The other main bases have
sunk into the Darkness.

00:21:02.266 --> 00:21:03.266
But!

00:21:03.500 --> 00:21:05.430
Leave it to
the captain's discretion.

00:21:05.966 --> 00:21:07.826
All workers, find shelter inside!

00:21:08.466 --> 00:21:10.766
And begin energy infusion
to the generator!

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:12.630
Beginning energy infusion.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:14.200
10%...

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:18.970
20%... 30%... 40%...

00:21:19.533 --> 00:21:22.233
- 50%... 60%...
- Two minutes until contact.

00:21:23.033 --> 00:21:25.903
70%... 80%...

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.600
90%... 100%!

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:32.030
Activating Shadow Shield!

00:21:40.533 --> 00:21:41.533
No way!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:44.270
Increase the energy infusion rate!

00:21:44.733 --> 00:21:46.333
But according to the calculationsâ€”

00:21:46.366 --> 00:21:47.366
Increase!

00:21:48.033 --> 00:21:49.233
107%...

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.270
108%... 109%...

00:21:54.033 --> 00:21:55.203
110%...

00:21:55.966 --> 00:21:56.966
We can't go any higher!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:58.430
One minute until contact!

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:02.000
112%... 113%...

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:03.530
- It's coming, maro!
- 114%...

00:22:03.566 --> 00:22:05.266
- Oh no!
- 115%...

00:22:05.566 --> 00:22:12.096
116%... 117%... 118%... 119%...

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:13.870
120%!

00:22:14.133 --> 00:22:15.133
Activate!

00:22:21.033 --> 00:22:23.303
The Shadow Shield is holding!

00:22:24.566 --> 00:22:25.626
It's stabilized!

00:22:27.033 --> 00:22:28.033
Launch!

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:33.330
General Logi,
what are your orders?!

00:22:33.866 --> 00:22:37.396
We're going to take this ship
right into the heart of Darkness!

00:24:17.466 --> 00:24:18.926
The battleship carrying
Shu and the others

00:24:18.966 --> 00:24:20.996
successfully breaks through
to the inside of the Darkness.

00:24:21.033 --> 00:24:22.533
Marumaro, what're you doing?

00:24:22.566 --> 00:24:24.866
Shh! Someone's taking
a shower, maro.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.000
Let me have a look.
Long hair, huh?

00:24:27.033 --> 00:24:29.703
That's outrageous, maro.
How obscene, maro.

00:24:29.733 --> 00:24:31.703
Who's peeping at me in the bath?

00:24:31.733 --> 00:24:32.403
Logi!

00:24:32.433 --> 00:24:33.503
Ewww, maro.

00:24:33.533 --> 00:24:35.703
Next on Blue Dragon:
Into the Darkness
